{"type":"message","id":"7c436aed","parentId":"5959ce8d","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:08:09.148Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 6:08 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773396489147}}
{"type":"message","id":"8b1b4488","parentId":"7c436aed","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:08:21.273Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求执行一个定时任务，内容是：\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n当前时间是 2026年3月13日，星期五，下午6:08（北京时间）\n\n我需要：\n1. 使用 clawhub skill 来搜索 ClawHub 上的技能\n2. 根据条件筛选\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 将报告写入 memory/evolution-2026-03-13.md\n\n首先，我应该读取 clawhub skill 的 SKILL.md 文件，了解如何使用 clawhub CLI。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行技能自动进化任务。首先读取 clawhub skill 的使用指南。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c3b22dd1c67b471597940006","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":217,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15674,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.0006944000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0134378}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773396489148}}
{"type":"message","id":"878ecfce","parentId":"8b1b4488","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:08:21.279Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_c3b22dd1c67b471597940006","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773396501278}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b803598","parentId":"878ecfce","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:08:29.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我了解了 clawhub CLI 的基本用法。现在我需要：\n\n1. 使用 `clawhub search` 搜索关键词\n2. 筛选符合条件的技能\n3. 使用 `clawhub install` 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成报告并写入文件\n\n让我先搜索这些关键词。关键词列表：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我会逐个搜索这些关键词，然后汇总结果。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_83b77fb4a0074693b4aaa0e8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search calendar"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1b8b14b56b464606a551e351","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search task"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c35e19855cf84723bc235cc9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search document"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_a3af59b7378648f99f9b33e8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search meeting"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":696,"output":149,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16269,"cost":{"input":0.000696,"output":0.00047680000000000004,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0042576}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773396501280}}
