{"type":"message","id":"382f4be0","parentId":"d808cae8","timestamp":"2026-03-13T10:09:46.614Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"很好！现在我有了所有关键词的搜索结果。让我汇总一下：\n\n**Calendar 相关（10个）：**\n1. calendar - Calendar (3.704)\n2. gcalcli-calendar - Google Calendar (via gcalcli) (3.655)\n3. feishu-calendar - feishu-calendar (3.626)\n4. lark-calendar - Lark Calendar & Tasks (3.588)\n5. gog-calendar - Google Calendar (via gogcli) (3.568)\n6. macos-calendar - macOS Calendar (3.563)\n7. brainz-calendar - Calendar (3.514)\n8. calendar-manager - Calendar Manager (3.466)\n9. yandex-calendar - yandex-calendar (3.461)\n10. dingtalk-calendar - Dingtalk Calendar (3.449)\n\n**Task 相关（10个）：**\n1. task - Task (3.630)\n2. async-task - Async Task (3.549)\n3. agent-task-tracker - Task Tracker (3.525)\n4. task-father - Task Father (3.482)\n5. queue-task - Queue Task (3.407)\n6. task-watchdog - 任务守望者与弹窗杀手 (Task Watchdog) (3.394)\n7. openclaw-skill-m365-task-manager-by-altf1be - Openclaw Skill M365 Task Manager (3.381)\n8. feishu-task-integration-skill - feishu-task-integration-skill (3.354)\n9. task-ledger - Task Ledger (3.344)\n10. agent-task-logger - Agent Task Logger (3.324)\n\n**Email 相关（10个）：**\n1. email-daily-summary - Automatically logs into email accounts (3.582)\n\n\n2. react-email-skills - React Email Skills (3.480)\n3. email-best-practices - Email Best Practices (3.472)\n4. email-marketing - Email Marketing (3.470)\n5. porteden-email - PortEden - secured email (3.455)\n6. openclaw-email-bypass - Openclaw Email Bypass (3.399)\n7. email-163-com - email-163-com (3.391)\n8. email-design - Email Design (3.355)\n9. bot-email - BotEmail.ai - Free bot email (3.338)\n\nEmail 模块涵盖了多个实用方向：日常邮件摘要、最佳实践、营销策略和安全设计等。这些技能覆盖了从基础邮件管理到高级营销的全方位需求。\n\n特别关注 bot-email 和 email-reader 这样的工具，它们能显著提升邮件处理效率。\n\n在笔记管理领域，Apple Notes 和 Bear Notes 等工具提供了多样化的记录和组织方式。个人笔记系统支持跨平台同步，满足不同用户需求。AI会议笔记和语音笔记等创新功能，进一步丰富了笔记应用的场景和可能性。 记录员-小茹 提供多样记录功能，支持多种场景灵活应用。\n\n自动化工作流程工具覆盖广泛领域，从网络自动化到业务流程，满足不同需求。重点工具包括AI网络自动化、社交媒体自动化和业务流程自动化等。\n\n需要进一步调查这些工具的具体细节，包括下载量和更新时间，以确保选择最合适的解决方案。\n\n目前面临API限制，需要采用替代方案。\n\n我计划根据工具评分和实用性进行初步筛选，同时查看本地已安装的工具列表。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1406f5a5d0d2446fadb8172e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub list"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":759,"output":743,"cacheRead":16896,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18398,"cost":{"input":0.000759,"output":0.0023776,"cacheRead":0.0033792,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0065158}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773396561184}}
